# Ailaysa E-Commerce Application

A modern, clean e-commerce application built with Next.js 14, featuring user authentication and product management.

## Features Implemented

### ✅ User Authentication
- **Login Page**: Email and password authentication with a beautiful UI matching the Figma design
- **Session Management**: User credentials persisted in cookies and managed via Zustand
- **Logout Functionality**: Secure logout that clears session data
- **Protected Routes**: Automatic redirect to login if not authenticated

### ✅ Product Management
- **Product Listing**: Display products fetched from Fake Store API
- **Category Filter**: Filter products by category (electronics, jewelery, men's clothing, women's clothing)
- **Create Product**: Add new products via modal form with API integration
- **Delete Product**: Remove products from the list (locally after API call)
- **Product Details**: Detailed view showing title, price, description, category, image, and rating

### ✅ Bonus Features
- **Wishlist**: Add/remove products from wishlist (persisted in localStorage)
- **Category Filter**: Fully functional category filtering system

## Tech Stack

- **Framework**: Next.js 14 (App Router)
- **State Management**: Zustand
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS
- **Cookie Management**: js-cookie
- **API**: Fake Store API

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── page.js              # Login page
│   ├── products/
│   │   ├── page.js          # Products listing page
│   │   └── [id]/page.js     # Product details page
│   ├── layout.js
│   └── globals.css
├── components/
│   ├── ProductCard.js       # Product card component
│   └── CreateProductModal.js # Create product modal
└── store/
    ├── authStore.js         # Authentication state management
    └── productStore.js      # Product state management
```

## Getting Started

1. **Install Dependencies**:
   ```bash
   npm install
   ```

2. **Run Development Server**:
   ```bash
   npm run dev
   ```

3. **Open Browser**:
   Navigate to [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000)

## Usage

### Login
1. Enter any email and password (no validation required for demo)
2. Click "Sign in" to access the products page

### Products Page
- **View Products**: Browse all available products
- **Filter by Category**: Click category buttons to filter
- **Wishlist**: Click the heart icon on any product card
- **Create Product**: Click the "+ Create Product" button in the top right
- **Delete Product**: Click the "Delete" button on any product card
- **View Details**: Click on any product card to see full details

### Product Details
- View comprehensive product information
- Delete product from this page as well
- Navigate back to products list

