## API Integration

All API calls use the Fake Store API:
- `GET /products` - Fetch all products
- `GET /products/category/:category` - Fetch products by category
- `POST /products` - Create new product
- `DELETE /products/:id` - Delete product
- `GET /products/:id` - Fetch single product

## Notes

- The delete operation only removes products locally as the Fake Store API is a mock API
- Authentication is simplified for demo purposes
- The application follows Next.js best practices with App Router
- All components are client-side rendered where necessary
